# Data & Large Archives (Downloaded from Kaggle / external sources)
# Note the `**`: a bare `data/*.csv` would only match files directly under
# data/, not the nested data/dataset/ the loaders actually read from.
data/**/*.csv
data/**/*.zip
data/**/*.parquet
data/**/*.tar.gz

# Private working notes — kept on the local machine, never committed.
INTERVIEW_PREP.md
RULES.md
SCOPE.md
TASKS.md

